              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhurula khubemiyika amakhumi kataru nende abashilaho, okhuula khubemiyika amakhumi karaano, obabale, buli mundu owinjila mubukhalabani obwo, okhukhola emilimo chieliheema liokhwakaana. ",
          "type": "text",
