              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buno nibwo obukhalabani bwabetsinzu tsiabaana baMerari, obukhalabani bwabwe bwosi mukeliheema liokhwakaana shinga olwa buli, nibuli mumukhono kwaItsamari waHaruni omukuhani.",
          "type": "text",
